"usage: git.commit.push [--mode plan|apply] [--auth as-ehmpath|as-human] [--output tree|json] [--pr-title-fallback "..."] [--debug]

options:
  --mode plan|apply            plan shows preview, apply executes (default: plan)
  --auth as-ehmpath|as-human   who opens the pr (default: as-ehmpath)
                               as-ehmpath = seaturtle bot via ehmpath keyrack token
                               as-human   = the gh cli login (fallback on keyrack failure)
  --output tree|json           tree for standalone, json for composition (default: tree)
  --pr-title-fallback "..."    fallback pr title when no commits on branch yet
  --debug                      show verbose debug output
  --help, -h                   show this help
"
`;

