exports[`git.commit.push.sh given: [case32] EXTERNAL_CALL_TIMEOUT bounds a stalled keyrack so the guide still fires when: [t0] rhachet hangs, but the timeout is lowered to 1s then: the fetch is bounded and the as-human guide fires fast 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.commit.push
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: ehmpath keyrack token not available

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ your commit is pushed; to open its pr, unlock the ehmpath keyrack, so the seaturtle can open the pr, or open the pr with the human's github login
   ├─ rhx keyrack unlock --owner ehmpath --env prep --key EHMPATHY_SEATURTLE_GITHUB_TOKEN
   └─ rhx git.commit.push --mode apply --auth as-human
"
`;

