exports[`git.commit.push.sh given: [case35] identity-sync guard fires when the token identity ≠ the commit author when: [t0] HEAD is a standard seaturtle commit, but the token is an app-bot (ghs_) then: the pr-open is refused before any gh call (no 3rd contributor) 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.commit.push
   ├─ authored by: seaturtle[bot]
   ├─ pr opener: ehm-a-seaturtle[bot]
   ├─ why: a pr opened now would show a 3rd contributor on squash
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: pr-open identity out of sync with the commit author

