exports[`git.commit.push.sh given: [case39] --auth as-human + --output json emits a json error when gh is not logged in when: [t0] json output, push succeeds, ambient gh login unavailable then: stdout carries a machine-readable error, stderr carries the two-fix guide 2`] = `
